<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλη</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span> (B) (or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλή</span></b>  acc. to Sch.<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			10.7
		</span></i>, to dist. it from foreg.), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the finest meal</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀλφίτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Ren.Ves.</u>
				6.7
			</span></i>, Arching. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.791
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πυρίνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lycus
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.51.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρθηκος πάλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zopyr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. eund.<i><span class="en">
				14.61.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>any fine dust</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέπλησα τὠφθαλμὼ πάλης φυσῶν τὸ πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					60
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Cf. Lat. <i>pollen, pulvis.</i>)</div>
